{"content":[{"c":["MILCOM*"],"sourceClass":"h1","t":"p"},{"c":["National god of the Ammonites, better known as Molech or Moloch. Worship of this deity, which was accompanied by sacrificing children in the fire, was strictly prohibited to Israel (",{"href":"?bref=Lev.18.21","r":"Lev.18.21","rawR":"Lev.18.21","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Lev.18.21","value":"Lev.18.21"}],"t":"ref","v":"Lev 18:21"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.32.35","r":"Jer.32.35","rawR":"Jer.32.35","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.32.35","value":"Jer.32.35"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 32:35"},"). Solomon built Milcom a worship site (",{"href":"?bref=1Kgs.11.5,33","r":"1Kgs.11.5,33","rawR":"1Kgs.11.5,33","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Kgs.11.5,33","value":"1Kgs.11.5,33"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Kgs 11:5, 33"},"), which Josiah later tore down (",{"href":"?bref=2Kgs.23.13","r":"2Kgs.23.13","rawR":"2Kgs.23.13","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Kgs.23.13","value":"2Kgs.23.13"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Kgs 23:13"},"). Milcom is rendered as “king” in ",{"href":"?bref=2Sam.12.30","r":"2Sam.12.30","rawR":"2Sam.12.30","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"2Sam.12.30","value":"2Sam.12.30"}],"t":"ref","v":"2 Samuel 12:30"}," and ",{"href":"?bref=1Chr.20.2","r":"1Chr.20.2","rawR":"1Chr.20.2","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"1Chr.20.2","value":"1Chr.20.2"}],"t":"ref","v":"1 Chronicles 20:2"}," (see also ",{"href":"?bref=Jer.49.1-3","r":"Jer.49.1-3","rawR":"Jer.49.1-3","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Jer.49.1-3","value":"Jer.49.1-3"}],"t":"ref","v":"Jer 49:1-3"},"; ",{"href":"?bref=Zeph.1.5","r":"Zeph.1.5","rawR":"Zeph.1.5","sourceRefs":[{"raw":"Zeph.1.5","value":"Zeph.1.5"}],"t":"ref","v":"Zep 1:5"},", ",{"c":["kjv"],"sourceClass":"sc","t":"span"}," “Malcham”)."],"sourceClass":"fl","t":"p"},{"c":[{"c":["See also"],"sourceClass":"ital","t":"span"}," ",{"href":"?item=AmmonAmmonites_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","id":"AmmonAmmonites_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","rawId":"AmmonAmmonites_Article_TyndaleOpenBibleDictionary","t":"link","v":"Ammon, Ammonites"},"."],"sourceClass":"","t":"p"}],"format":"b